  </div>
</section>

<!-- INTRO SECTION -->
<section class="acdt-intro content-section" aria-labelledby="cet-est-intro-heading">
  <h2 id="cet-est-intro-heading" class="sr-only">About Central European Time to Eastern Standard Time Conversion</h2>
  <p>
    Welcome to our dedicated <strong>CET to EST Time Zone Converter</strong>. Converting time between Central European Time (CET, UTC+1) and Eastern Standard Time (EST, UTC-5) involves bridging a <strong>6-hour time gap across the Atlantic Ocean</strong>. CET is standard winter time across more than 30 European nations, including major industrial hubs like Paris, Berlin, Rome, Madrid, Amsterdam, Brussels, Frankfurt, and Zurich. Meanwhile, EST governs the eastern seaboard of North America during standard winter months, including New York City, Washington D.C., Toronto, Boston, and Miami.
  </p>
  <p>
    Managing communication across a 6-hour difference requires strategic coordination. When professionals in Paris or Frankfurt return from lunch around 1:00 PM CET, colleagues on the US East Coast are just starting their morning routines at 7:00 AM EST. The primary operational window for live calls, virtual conferences, and real-time trade support falls between 3:00 PM and 6:00 PM CET, which maps directly to 9:00 AM through 12:00 PM EST.
  </p>
  <p>
    Our online converter handles the math automatically, eliminating manual counting mistakes and accounting for date-line changes when late-night events in Europe correspond to afternoon hours in America. Whether you are a corporate executive coordinating European subsidiary operations, an international logistics manager, or a software engineer deploying cloud infrastructure, this tool provides instant accuracy.
  </p>
  <p>
    Backed by official IANA time zone database standards (`Europe/Paris` and `America/New_York`), this reference guide equips you with live clocks, complete 24-hour conversion tables, visual infographics, and scheduling best practices for transatlantic alignment.
  </p>
</section>

<!-- INTERACTIVE CONVERTER & SVG HERO -->
<section class="hero" id="converter-section" aria-labelledby="converter-heading">
  <div class="hero-copy">
    <p class="eyebrow">Interactive Timezone Utility</p>
    <h2 id="converter-heading">Convert CET to Eastern Standard Time</h2>
    <p>
      Use the dynamic converter below to transform any Central European Time timestamp into Eastern Standard Time. Select any date to view exact clock alignments.
    </p>

    <!-- Custom Visual SVG: Eiffel Tower & NYC Skyline -->
